{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker Shot is a turn-based skill-crafting roguelike where every fight becomes a little experiment in chaos. Explore a mysterious world filled with strange creatures and clever encounters, and take them down using skills you build entirely from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/e5e21db454da4b8894214d7fc2735c68.poster.avif?t=1772509231\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/e5e21db454da4b8894214d7fc2735c68.webm?t=1772509231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/e5e21db454da4b8894214d7fc2735c68.mp4?t=1772509231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Wildly Broken Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new abilities by mixing parts, effects, and upgrades to create wild combos, from surprisingly effective to delightfully broken. Each run pushes you to invent new strategies, adapt to unusual situations, and discover unexpected synergies hidden in your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/ed57d3d225ad1afeea6b056f4c06e593.poster.avif?t=1772509231\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/ed57d3d225ad1afeea6b056f4c06e593.webm?t=1772509231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/ed57d3d225ad1afeea6b056f4c06e593.mp4?t=1772509231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Run Feels Fresh</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven encounters, unpredictable scenarios, and a constantly evolving toolkit make every run feel fresh, playful, and full of discovery. No two battles play out the same, and no two skills you craft will ever be alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/e8aac5c088cac192f79fdf0300b63dc2.poster.avif?t=1772509231\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/e8aac5c088cac192f79fdf0300b63dc2.webm?t=1772509231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/e8aac5c088cac192f79fdf0300b63dc2.mp4?t=1772509231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive Into the Underground Ruins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, fire, experiment\u2026 and dive deeper into the Underground Ruins. Fresh challenges await in every corner, with unpredictable encounters and hidden surprises designed to keep each run feeling new. The deeper you go, the stranger the enemies and relics you find become, ensuring there\u2019s always something unexpected waiting beneath the surface.</p><br><strong><i><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to wishlist Tinker Shot to be notified when the game is released!</p></i></strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3351280?t=1772509231","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772509231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/250cc4761f856398c3892c8c4ac69e27eea6a123/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772509231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap